# Ad hoc local backup of frontend/ (including node_modules) — not a build
# artifact, not referenced by anything in the repo. Recommended for removal
# entirely; ignored here in the meantime so it can't be committed by
# accident. See specs/remaining-standardization-plan.md.
frontend.zip
# scripts/ragas_eval.py's per-run detail artifacts (run_<id>.json +
# raw_<timestamp>.jsonl) — growing without bound, reviewed locally, not
# meant to accumulate in git history the way eval_results/history.csv's
# one-row-per-run log does. See docs/evaluation.md.
eval_results/runs/
